          "from": "народ /naˈrod/ 'people' and дрова /droˈva/ 'firewood'",
          "to": "[nʌˈrot], [drʌˈva]",
          "note": "Pretonic /a/ (народ) and /o/ (дрова) fall together as [ʌ]."
